// ............................................................................ 
// Quests
// ............................................................................ 

Q_ORSIPARTY_S                   Attend Count Orsi's party.
Q_ORSIPARTY_L                   Enter Orsi's Mansion in Western Ringstrasse and mingle.
Q_INFILTRATE_S                  Find Secret Entrance to Clock.
Q_INFILTRATE_L                  Travel by rooftop from the Inner Stradt to the Clock Face.
Q_DESTROYLUTHER_S               Find Luther Black.
Q_DESTROYLUTHER_L               Locate the Vampire Priest Luther Black within Stephansdom Church.
Q_ESCAPEKNIGHTBASE_S            Escape the Teutonic Knight Base.
Q_ESCAPEKNIGHTBASE_L            Engage the Knights of Deutschordens Kirche and escape to the Inner Stradt.
Q_ETRIUSJOURNAL_S               Retrieve the Journal of Etrius.
Q_ETRIUSJOURNAL_L               Enter the Haus de Hexe and unlock the Arcanulum Door to recover the Journal.
Q_RETURNTOPRAGUE_S              Return to Prague.
Q_RETURNTOPRAGUE_L              Leave Vienna by the North Gate to return to Prague.
Q_RETURNAMULET_S                Bring the amulet to Orvus.
Q_RETURNAMULET_L                Bring the Tremere Amulet to Orvus in Eastern Ringstrasse.

